{{also|Donderdag}}
==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|donresdach}}, {{m|dum|donredach}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*thonaresdag}}, from late {{der|nl|gem-pro|*Þunras dagaz||day of Thor}}. Compare {{cog|nds|Dunnersdag}}, {{cog|de|Donnerstag}}, {{cog|fy|tongersdei}}, {{cog|en|Thursday}}, {{cog|da|torsdag}}.

Thor was the [[Germanic]] god of the thunder.

